&lt;figure class="portfolio-logic-rail portfolio-logic-rail--failure-gate"&gt;
&lt;figcaption&gt;
&lt;span&gt;Root Cause Analysis · Scale-up Stop Gate&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Judge scale-up by substrate damage, particles, and reusability—not removal time alone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;small&gt;Failure chain: no exhaust infrastructure → chemical removed → higher impact and residence → erosion in fixed overlap zones&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;span class="portfolio-logic-rail__index"&gt;01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;LEGACY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About three-day strip and clean&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;span class="portfolio-logic-rail__index"&gt;02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;LAB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chemical&amp;#43;ultrasound about eight hours&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;span class="portfolio-logic-rail__index"&gt;03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONSTRAINT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No exhaust and no chemical&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;span class="portfolio-logic-rail__index"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;SCALE-UP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Water&amp;#43;ultrasound/manual about 1.5 days&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;span class="portfolio-logic-rail__index"&gt;05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;FAILURE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Erosion, particles, and reuse&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;span class="portfolio-logic-rail__index"&gt;06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;STOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legacy return and future gates&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h2 id="1-process-condition-transition"&gt;1. Process-condition transition&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Stage&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Process configuration&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;Work time&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Quality state&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Legacy&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Bead blast, chemical, high-pressure/manual work, cleaning, and drying&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;About three days&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Existing reuse criteria&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Initial limited trial&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Existing stripping chemical plus ultrasound&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;About eight hours&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Removal feasibility&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Scale-up&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Water, ultrasound, high-pressure water, and manual work&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;About one and a half days&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Erosion, particle, and reuse failure&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The scale-up equipment did not include the fume-exhaust infrastructure required for chemical use. Removing chemical action increased dependence on ultrasonic impact, high-pressure water, manual work, and equipment residence time.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>